<!--
  Audit rules for:
    Audit rules ID:           100700 - 100792
    Passwd rules ID:          100793 - 100799

  Custom copy of the default auditd ruleset for WS-41387
  (Datec // Compañía de Seguros Fortaleza).

  Changes vs. the stock ruleset:
    - Rule IDs moved from the default 807xx range into the local/custom
      range 1007xx (100000-120000 is reserved for local rules) to avoid
      colliding with the default ruleset.
    - Rule 100700 now matches <decoded_as>auditd-custom</decoded_as> instead
      of <decoded_as>auditd</decoded_as>, since events arrive via rsyslog
      with a syslog header and are decoded by the custom "auditd-custom"
      decoder (see decoders.xml in this same folder) rather than the
      default auditd decoder.
-->

